      "id": "shape:text16",
      "typeName": "shape",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 920,
      "rotation": 0,
      "index": "aGZxj",
      "parentId": "page:page",
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "props": {
        "color": "grey",
        "size": "s",
        "font": "sans",
        "textAlign": "start",
        "w": 1060,
        "richText": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "• \"Retrying\" is not a status: it is PENDING with attempts > 0 (CS sees \"waiting to retry, attempt 4, next at 14:20\")."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "• Unknown outcome (timeout, 5xx, expired SENDING lease) ⇒ next attempt looks up before creating (ADR 0004). A fresh PENDING row creates directly."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "• Outcome writes are fenced on lease_owner, but a returned remote record ID is always saved."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "• 429 also sets paused_until = now + Retry-After on the whole connection."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "scale": 1,
        "autoSize": false
      }
    }
  ]
}